=== Structured Context Sample ===
--- 1. with var x = expr ---
  greeting=hello
  GetString()=hello
--- 2. with Type x = expr ---
  count=42
  GetInt()=42
--- 3. with Type _ = expr ---
  GetConfig()=from-discard
--- 4. with expr ---
  GetLocale()=en-US
--- 5. with(expr) { ... } ---
  inside block: GetString()=scoped-value
  after block: GetString()=hello
--- 6. Propagation through call chain ---
  CallGetString()=hello
  CallCallGetString()=hello
--- 7. Shadowing and restoration ---
  before shadow: GetInt()=42
  inside shadow: GetInt()=99
  after restore: GetInt()=42
--- 8. Multiple with-clauses ---
  GetBoth()=s=hello, n=42
--- 9. Variance control ---
  GetConfig() with DetailedConfig as Config=detailed
--- 10. Multiple same-type pushes ---
  after first push: GetInt()=200
  after second push: GetInt()=300
  after inner pop: GetInt()=200
--- 11. Independent type keys ---
  GetHolderInt()=10
  GetHolderString()=generic
  Holder<int>=11
  Holder<string>=closed-generic
--- 12. Constructor with-clause ---
  Greeter.Greeting=Hello, world
--- 13. Various types as context values ---
  class (Config): GetConfig()=detailed
  struct (Locale): GetLocale()=en-US
  abstract type-implementing (CountReader): CountReader(ReadContext with 0 would be: ready)
  abstract type-implementing (ConsumerImpl): ConsumerImpl(ready)
--- 14. Advanced type keys ---
  type alias (Name=string): GetString()=via-alias
  union type (IntOrBool): GetInt()=42 (proves distinct key)
  refinement type (PositiveInt=int>=1): GetInt()=5 (shares int key)
  after refinement pop: GetInt()=42
  dependent type (Sized<5>): GetSized()=5
--- 15. Abstract type dispatch with with-clause ---
  IContextConsumer.Consume()=ConsumerImpl.Consume: cfg=detailed
--- 16. Abstract type dispatch with with-clause ---
  ContextReader.ReadContext()=CountReader.ReadContext: count=7
--- 17. Optional and nested type keys ---
  string under absent string?=world
  string?=absent
  shadowed string?=optional-inner
  string stays=world
  restored string?=absent
  string after optional pop=world
  int under absent int?=7
  int? fallback=-1
  nested tuple=tuple-outer
  optional nested tuple=absent
  function=function-outer
  optional-result function=absent
--- 18. Extension and default body entry ---
  extension=x:7
  abstract default=world
  concrete default=world
--- 19. Generic context keys ---
  Get<string?>=generic-optional
  Get<string>=generic-required
  Outer<string?>=generic-optional
  Shadow<string?>=generic-shadow
  restored Get<string?>=generic-optional
  Keyed<string?>.Read()=generic-optional
  Keyed<string>.Seeded=generic-required
  extension Ambient<string?>=generic-optional
  reference=generic-optional
  abstract Get<string?>=generic-optional Get<string>=generic-required
  closed answer Read()=generic-optional
  Get<int?>=21 Get<int>=42
--- 20. Execution flow isolation ---
  parent with overlapping children=parent ready=True
  first child=parent|first|released=True
  parent while second remains=parent
  second child=parent|second|released=True
  parent after children=parent
  caller after children=generic-required
=== Structured Context Done ===
